<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 200 billion lire step-up bond,call.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 200 billion lire step-up bond,call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banca Monte dei Paschi di Siena, Banca</p>
<p>Nazionale del Lavoro and Istituto Bancario San Paulo di Torino.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     *8.55     MATURITY  **29.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.755   PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO THEN STEPS UP TO 9.0 PCT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    **CALL ON 29.OCT.98</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
